        "text": "SpaceX just laid out a major plan to protect and restore the coastline around its launch site\n\nBoca Chica Beach is staying public as Starbase keeps growing\n\nMore than 50 tons of trash already removed through weekly beach cleanups with the City of Starbase\n\nTens of millions of dollars offered to fight erosion, restore the shoreline and keep public access open\n\nOngoing support for conservation groups rescuing sea turtles\n\nThe proposed land purchase covers about 1,200 acres around the launch facility, with Boca Chica Beach and the Texas coastline left out of it\n\nAround 600 of those acres would be permanently protected as sensitive coastal habitat\n\nMoney from the sale would help Texas build new parks and recreation across the Rio Grande Valley\n\nStarbase grows, and the beach stays open to everyone",
